flowchart TD
    A[Owner enters pets, tasks, and availability]
    N[Evaluation Harness]
    B[PawPal Scheduler generates draft plan]
    C[Conflict Detector checks overlapping tasks]
    D[Care Rule Retriever searches custom instructions]
    E[AI Plan Critic analyzes draft plan]
    F[AI Repair Agent proposes task changes]
    G[Deterministic Schedule Validator]
    M[Save structured agent log]
    H{Proposal valid?}
    J[Human approval]
    K[Apply approved changes]
    L[Display final schedule]

    A --> B
    B --> C
    C --> E
    D --> E
    E --> F
    F --> G
    G --> H
    H -- No, first failure --> F
    H -- No, final failure --> J
    H -- Yes --> J
    J -- Approve --> K
    J -- Reject --> L
    K --> L

    E --> M
    F --> M
    G --> M
    J --> M

    N --> B
    N --> D
    N --> E
    N --> G
